    "note": "Federal estimated tax is paid on 15 April, 15 June, 15 September and 15 January; the annual return and balance are due on 15 April. State sales tax, where it applies, is usually filed monthly or quarterly around the 20th (the vault uses the 20th of the month after the quarter).",
